  "description": "Wi-Fi remote I/O module with digital inputs and outputs, analog inputs and outputs and input counters, with a Modbus RTU slave on its serial port and a Modbus TCP slave over Wi-Fi, and MQTT",
  "revision": 1,
  "source": "Exemys, RMW1-RM-WiFi Manual del usuario, Rev. 5",
