      "note": "Modbus register table",
      "accessed": "2026-11-15",
      "sha256": "0a1d614ab73e87ae91e1fcf52de45fd1a1cfafc0ac392cdf7987fc73e3f6ea34"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "The module has two independent Modbus slaves: one on the RS-232 / RS-485 port and one Modbus TCP (up to 4 simultaneous connections), both with slave ID 100 by default.",
    "Register numbers are the manual's: 00001 coils, 10001 discrete inputs, 30001 input registers and 40001 holding registers (the holding registers repeat the input registers; counters and outputs can be written).",
    "Register numbers are those of the manual (40001 is the first holding register), counted from 1 (address_base 1).",
    "Written from the manufacturer's manual (in Spanish); not tested on a device."
  ],
  "protocol": "tcp+rtu",
